    "sections": {
        "description": "The Creative Designer theme is designed for professionals and studios focused on presenting creative work, visual concepts, and portfolio-based projects. It includes structured layouts for showcasing designs, project galleries, service details, testimonials, and contact information. The responsive design ensures smooth viewing across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Customization options allow adjustments to typography, colors, banners, and page layouts to match different creative styles. The theme also supports portfolio filtering, blog sections, image galleries, and call-to-action areas for presenting work in an organized manner. Suitable for a design studio, freelancer, agency, or creative professional, the layout provides a clean framework for highlighting branding work, visual concepts, and project case studies. It helps present design-focused content in a structured and accessible format without unnecessary complexity."
    },
